      "description": {
        "en": "Active throughout the mission: regular enemy movement gains 20% speed; firearms, melee attacks and special actions gain 40% speed. Corresponding attack windups, hit or release timings, recovery and cooldowns are shortened, with synchronized animations. Movement starts, stops, spawn exits, cover entry, received stagger and obstacle traversal retain their native handling. Requires the audited Windows game build and the native helper included with HCM.",
